<title>ARMENIA: Armenia Jan-Sept industry output rises 1.5 pct yr/.</title>
<headline>Armenia Jan-Sept industry output rises 1.5 pct yr/.</headline>
<dateline>YEREVAN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armenian industrial production in the first nine months of this year was 1.5 percent higher than in the same 1995 period, the National Statistics Committee said.</p>
<p>Output in September rose 8.4 percent from August, but was 1.1 percent lower than a year earlier.</p>
<p>    ARMENIA INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     SEP 96    AUG 96    SEP 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	+8.4	 +6.7	N/A</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	  -1.1	 +9.2	N/A</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
